  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Carreteras II Ceara</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Roads Program II - Ceara</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROPOSED PROGRAM HAS 5 COMPONENTS: DUPLICATION OF 52 KM OF ROADS IN METROPOLITAN FORTALEZA; CONVENTIONAL PAVING OF 420 KMS OF INTERURBAN ROADS AND LOW-COST PAVING OF 450 KM; RESTORATION OF 530 KMS; SEALING OF 390 KM; AND INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING, INCLUDING TECHNICAL ASSISTANCE, INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY AND EQUIPMENTE (SAFETY, SCALES, OTHERS)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
